<title>USA: BASEBALL-OPENING DAY MAJOR LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASEBALL-OPENING DAY MAJOR LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Major League</p>
<p>Baseball games played on Tuesday, opening day of the 1997</p>
<p>season (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>	    National League</p>
<p> MONTREAL	  2   St Louis	  1</p>
<p> CINCINNATI     11   Colorado	  4</p>
<p> FLORIDA	   4   Chicago	   2</p>
<p> Philadelphia    3   LOS ANGELES     0</p>
<p> Pittsburgh	5   SAN FRANCISCO   2</p>
<p> SAN DIEGO	12   New York	  5</p>
<p> HOUSTON	   2   Atlanta	   1</p>
<p>	    American League</p>
<p> Chicago	   6   TORONTO	   5 (10 innings)</p>
<p> TEXAS	     6   Milwaukee	 2</p>
<p> SEATTLE	   4   New York	  2</p>
<p> MINNESOTA	 7   Detroit	   5</p>
<p>Kansas City at Baltimore (Postponed)</p>
</text>
